  "content": "\n\n```html\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。由爱打造。大量活跃模组支持 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">刷怪笼僵尸村民（Zombie Villagers From Spawner）是一款轻量级可配置模组，恢复了刷怪笼生成村民变异体僵尸的能力，该功能最初在 Minecraft 1.11 版本中被移除。</span><br><br></p>\n<p>您也可以关注 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-zombie-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>更多僵尸村民</strong></span></a>。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"已包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"已包含在 Serilum 的刷怪包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<details><summary>显示内容</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>isZombieVillagerChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 0.1，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">刷怪笼生成的新僵尸为村民变异体的概率。</span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由将此模组用于任何模组包，前提是下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何问题，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>\n```",
